{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2722dc72-a279-8756-97a7-71e6fab72deb",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T12:33:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:31:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. This is Judith Wilcox. So, growing up down by the harbor, we always had the one barrel at the curb and my dad wrote our name on it in marker. Anyway, I'm calling because my recycling bin is gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gone as in it went missing after pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I put it out last night for the collection this morning. It was there when I went to bed. After the truck came, it wasn't at the curb, and it's not on the street either. I looked up and down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bin missing after pickup. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "248 Ayrault Street, on Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two forty-eight Ayrault. Got it. Is it a blue recycling bin, or the trash one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The recycling bin. The trash can is still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, writing that down. Recycling bin, not returned, Ayrault Street. Did the driver leave anything, like a tag or a note on the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. Though I should say, the family downstairs has card nights and you can hear it faintly through the floor, so I was up late and I'd have noticed somebody moving it. Nobody was out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so probably the truck or the crew took it, or the wind got it. Either way we can look at getting you a replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:32:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd like a supervisor to call me back about it, please. I'd rather talk to somebody who can say what happens next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in the request for a supervisor callback. Best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-two. That's you, Judith Wilcox. Any time of day better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are fine. I'm home today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. With the holiday week it might be later today or Monday, but I'll flag it so they see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take care, and happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
